<view class="page detail-content"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty-note">正在读取 v3 详情…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="empty-note">{{error}}</view><block wx:elif="{{item}}"><image wx:if="{{item.imageUrl && !imageFailed}}" class="cover" src="{{item.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" aria-label="{{item.name}}公开图片" binderror="imageError"/><view wx:else class="cover image-fallback">公开图片暂缺</view><view class="eyebrow">贵州乌东 · {{kind}}</view><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="tags"><text class="tag" wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><view class="intro">{{item.description}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.demoPrice}}" class="price">¥{{item.demoPrice.amount}} <text>{{item.demoPrice.simulationNote}}</text></view><view wx:elif="{{item.referencePrice}}" class="price">¥{{item.referencePrice.amount}} <text>参考来源：{{item.referencePrice.sourceTitle}}</text></view><view wx:else class="empty-note">暂无可展示价格。</view><view class="service-note">请返回“游乌东”从当前目录选择并核价；详情页不会绕过同店、容量或报价确认边界。</view></block></view>
